  "_readme": "Three homepage sections parked out of templates/index.json on 2026-10-14.\n\nShopify renders at most 25 sections per JSON template. The restore in PR #151 put index.json at 28, so the GitHub integration silently refused to write it -- no error, no commit status, the theme simply kept the damaged copy. These three were the only sections in that file that had never been on the theme: they are repo-authored, were disabled in #151, and render nothing. Removing them brings the file to exactly 25.\n\nThey are kept verbatim here so the authored settings are not lost. To put one back, paste its object into `sections` in templates/index.json and add its id to `order` -- and remove another section in the same change, because the homepage is now at the cap. tests/shop-owned-templates.test.mjs enforces the limit.\n",
